  "bookId": "GEN",
  "reference": "Genese 42",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 38,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "42",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "GEN 42"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "42",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakamanya Yakoba ne, Bintu bia kudia biakashala mu Ejipitu, yeye wakambila bana bandi balume ne, Nudi batangilangana muaku bua tshinyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakamba kabidi ne, Monai, nakunvua lumu ne, Bintu bia kudia biakashala mu Ejipitu, yai bienu kuakua, nutusumbileku bia kudia, bua tuetu tuhanduke, katufu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bana babo ne Yosefe dikumi bakaya mu Ejipitu bua kusumbabo bia kudia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi Yakoba kakatuma Benyamina, muakunyi wa Yosefe, ne bana babo, wakamba ne, Bumue bualu bubi nebumukuate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bana balume ba Isalele bakalua mu tshisumbu tshia bantu bua kusumbabo bia kudia, bualu bua tshiole tshiakadi mu buloba bua Kanana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosefe wakadi mukokeshi wa mu buloba, nyeye mene wakadi uhanyisha bantu bonso bintu, bana babo ne Yosefe bakalua, bakamukukuila hanshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosefe wakamona bana babo, wakabamanya, kadi yeye wakadivuisha bu muntu mukuabo kudibo, wakabambila mei makole, wakabakonka ne, Nuakufuma kudi kunyi? Bakamukudimuna di ne, Mu buloba bua Kanana, tuakuluila bua kusumba bia kudia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosefe wakamana bana babo, kadi bobo kabakamumanya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosefe wakavuluka bua bilota biandi biakabaloteleye, yeye wakabambila ne, Nudi batentekedi, nuakuluila bua kutangila ne buloba budi butuhu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bobo bakamuambila ne, Nansha, mukelenge wetu, bantu bebe bakuluila anu bua kusumbabo bia kudia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buonso buetu tudi bana ba muntu umue, tudi bambe mei a bushuwa, katuena batentekedi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi yeye wakabambila ne, Nansha, nuakuluila anu bua kutangila ne buloba budi hatuhu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bobo bakamuku dimuna ne, Tuetu, bantu bebe, tudi bana dikumi ne babidi ba muntu umue wa mu buloba bua Kanana, ne mona, muana wa mukala udi mushale ne tatu wetu katataka, ne mukuabo kenaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosefe wakabambila ne, Adi ndi dinakunuambila ne, Nudi batentekedi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nennutete ku bualu ebu, ndi nditshiha ku muoyo wa Palô ne, Kanuena numuka kunoko anu hanualua ne muanʼenu, muanʼa mukala kunoko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nutume umue wa munkatshi muenu, alue biandi ne muanʼenu, muanʼa mukala kunoko, netunusuike mionshi buonso buenu, netutete mei enu, bua kumanya ne, Nudi nuamba mei malelela, anyi bualu bunakuditshiha ku muoyo wa Palo ne, Nudi batentekedi, nebuikale bulelela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakababuesha buonso buabo mu nsubu wa lukanu to matuku asatu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakahita matuku asatu, Yosefe wakabambila ne, Enzai nunku nushale ne muoyo, bualu bua meme ndi ntshina Nzambi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Binuamba mei malelela, nuitabushe bua: umue wenu ashale musuikibue mu nsubi wa lukanu, kadi bakuabo benu baye kuenu ne bia kudia bualu bua tshiole tshidi mu nsubu yenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nu hingane ne muanʼenu, muanʼa mukala kundi, nunku mei enu neajalame, kanuena nufue. Bobo bakitabusha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakambilangana ne, Tuetu tuakudihisha bulelela mu bualu bubi butuakenzela muanʼetu hatuakatangila kanyinganyinga ka mutshima wandi hakadiye utusengelela, kadi tuetu katuakamunvuila, bua bualu ebu dikenga diakatukuata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lubena wakabambila ne Tshiakanuambila ne, Kanuenzedi muana bualu bubi, kadi nuenu kanuakangunvuila, anyi? Nunku mashi andi adi ashala ha bilamba bienu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bobo kabakamanya ne, Yosefe wakadi ujingulula mei akadibo bambilangana, bualu bua muandamunyi wa miaku wakadiku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakabakoma nyima, wakadia, ne yeye wakatshinguluka kudibo, wakayikila nʼabo, wakakuata Shimeona, wakamusuika ku mesu kuabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe Yosefe wakambila ba ntu bandi ne, Nubushile bibombi biabo tente ne bia kudia, nuhingashe argent wa muntu ne muntu mu tshibombi tshiandi, nubahe bintu bia kudiabo mu nshila, bakenza nunku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakateka bintu bia kudia ha nyima ha mpunda yabo bakaya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakafikabo ku nsubu wa tshilala benyi, umue wabo wakasulula tshi bombi tshiandi bua kudisheye mpunda wandi, wakatangila argent yandi ba mutu ha tshibombi tshiandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakambila bana babo ne Bakumpingashila argent yanyi, idi mu tshibombi, mitshima yabo ya kahandika, bakazakala, bakambila ngana ne, Bualu ebu buakutuenzela Nzambi budi tshinyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakalua kudi Yakoba, tatuʼabo, mu buloba bua Kanana, bakamuambila malu onso akabakuata ne, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muntu au mukelenge wa mu buloba, wakatua mbila mei makole, wakatuenzela bu batentekedi ba buloba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tuetu tuakamuambila ne, Tudi bambe mei malelela, katuena batentekedi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "tudi bana dikumi ne babidi ba tatu umue, umue wetu kenaku, ne mua nʼetu, muanʼa mukala udi mushale ne tatu wetu mu buloba bua Kanâna. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muntu au, mukelenge wa buloba, wakabambila ne, Ku bualu ebu nemmanye ne, Nudi nuamba mei malelela, nushiye umue wenu kundi, bakuabo benu bangate bia kudia bia kumana nʼabi tshiole tshidi mu nsubu yenu, yai bienu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuhingane kundi ne muanʼenu, muan a mukala, hashishe nemmanye ne, Kanuena batentekedi nudi bantu ba mei a bushuwa nunku nempingashe muan enu mu bianza bienu, nenumanye mua kuendulula mushinga mu buloba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakahongololabo bintu biakadi mu bibombi biabo, bakasangana argent ya muntu ne muntu mu tshibombi tshiandi, hakamonabo, bobo ne tatu wabo argent yabo bakatshina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakoba, tatu wabo, wakabambila ne, Nuenu nuakunjimishila bana banyi Yosefe kenaku, ne Shimeona kenaku, ne nudi nuamba kuya ne Benyamina, malu au onso adi mantonde. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lubena wakambila tatu wandi ne, Udi mua kushiha bana banyi balume babidi, binahanga kumuhingasha kudi umufile mu tshianza tshianyi, ne meme nemmuhingashe kûdi kabidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakoba wakamba ne Muan anyi kena uya nʼenu, mukuluʼandi udi mufue ne anu yeye umuehele udi mushale, biamukuata bualu bubi mu nshila unuaya, hashishe, nenuvuishe nsuki yanyi mitoke to ne kanyinganyinga mu Muaba wa Bafue.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.38"
            ]
          }
        }
